# Copy to server/.tailscale.env for the FIRST start of the tailscale service only
# (docker-compose.funnel.yml). Git never tracks the copy, and only the tailscale
# container reads it - never the app.
#
# Tailscale admin console → Settings → Keys → Generate auth key (one-off, not
# ephemeral). Once the machine has joined, its identity lives in the
# tailscale-state volume: delete server/.tailscale.env, and the URL stays the
# same across restarts.
TS_AUTHKEY=
